        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>备忘录</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/3.2.2/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #1c1c1e;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .phone {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 730px;\n    background-color: #1c1c1e;\n    padding: 15px 18px 40px 18px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .topbar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 5px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .topbar .back {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .topbar .back .arrow {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    color: #cccccc;\n  }\n  .topbar .more {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: #cccccc;\n    border: 1px solid #555;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background-color: #4cd964;\n    color: #062b0c;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    margin: 14px 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  p.body-text {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin: 10px 0 18px 0;\n    color: #f0f0f0;\n  }\n  .label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  ol {\n    padding-left: 22px;\n    margin: 8px 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  ol li {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    color: #f0f0f0;\n  }\n  .airline-block {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin: 6px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .airline-row {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 40px;\n  }\n  .airline-row span {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"phone\">\n\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"back\"><span class=\"arrow\">&#8249;</span>备忘录</div>\n    <div class=\"more\">&#8943;</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">交通建议：</div>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text\">\n    <span class=\"label\">公交：</span>出行可以乘坐公交车，投币VX都可以支付。\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text\">\n    <span class=\"label\">电驴：</span>路边店铺租小电驴，或者找路边的共享小电驴也不错，人少方便，适合早上和傍晚，中午太晒了，容易中暑。\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text\">\n    <span class=\"label\">打车：</span>网约车、出租车均可，十几块钱都能去你想去的地方，外地人建议网约车，能知道大概价格路线。\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text\">\n    <span class=\"label\">其他：</span>共享单车/共享电动车，市区，洲岛到处都有很方便，但是要注意停车位置，可能难找。\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">购机票攻略：</div>\n\n  <ol>\n    <li>了解各大航班会员日\n      <div class=\"airline-block\">\n        <div class=\"airline-row\">\n          <span>中国国际航空：同月同日(1月1日、2月2日)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"airline-row\">\n          <span>厦门航空：每月9日</span><span>东方航空：每月9日</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"airline-row\">\n          <span>山东航空：同月同日</span><span>海南航空：每月8日</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"airline-row\">\n          <span>深圳航空：每月12日</span><span>四川航空：每月19日</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"airline-row\">\n          <span>吉祥航空：每月25日</span><span>南方航空：每月28日</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li>会员日的促销价格可在官网上查询~</li>\n    <li>有些特价航空的机票不提供免费的托运服务和餐食，可以在网上提前购买行李额，并自备好干粮。</li>\n    <li>一次性购买往返机票比分开购买单程票划算。</li>\n  </ol>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
